From d83f4dead951a23d0e903c3b138f55b1fcac908e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian MacDonald <ian@netstatz.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 17:39:24 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 026/102] fix(cli): accept --label image-classification in
 lemonade pull

A tflite model deploys as a text classifier unless its labels say
otherwise, so registering a user.* image classifier from the CLI needs
--label image-classification, which the CLI's allow-list rejected
("image-classification not in {chat,...}"). The server already accepts
the label for tflite.

Move the allow-list into lemon_cli/pull_labels.h so a cpp-ci unit test
(CliPullLabelsTest) can check it against the tflite descriptor.

Assisted-by: claude:opus-5.5
